      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Bluster sphere, ability to gain martial focus.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefits:</strong> Whenever you succeed at a skill check to affect a creature with one of your quips or it fails a saving throw against one, you may cause that creature to be battered for 1 round.</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/champion-feats#toc117\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
